[en.FOCUS_C12_SECRET_UNDER_THE_SEDIMENTARY]
Secret under the Sedimentary

[en.FOCUS_C12_SECRET_UNDER_THE_SEDIMENTARY_desc]
Although we had long heard of it, everything indicates that this black liquid flowing deep underground possesses a kind of magic we have never seen before. Regions like Las Pegasus had already begun researching this resource known as petroleum and developed outstanding devices powered by it—an approach now seen as the primary direction for the future. We weren’t entirely ignorant of this resource before; we had merely considered its reliable combustion efficiency suitable only for heating. In order to avoid falling behind places like Las Pegasus, we must rapidly deepen our understanding of this resource, even exploring laboratory synthesis methods.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_SECRET_UNDER_THE_SEDIMENTARY]
沉积岩之下

[zh.FOCUS_C12_SECRET_UNDER_THE_SEDIMENTARY_desc]
虽然我们对此早有耳闻，但是一切都表明这种流淌于地下深处的黑色血液拥有着我们从未见过的魔力，洛马基等地早已展开了对这种名为石油的资源的研究，并制造出依靠它来驱动的卓越设备，这被认为是未来的主要方向。我们此前并不是对这种资源一无所知，只是单纯考虑到这种资源可靠的燃烧效率将其用于单纯的供暖。为了避免落后于洛马基等地，我们需要迅速提高对这种资源的了解力度，甚至是实验室合成的办法。

